{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772212788\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772212788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1772212788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore without fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a serene, vibrant forest full of mysteries. There\u2019s no hunting or violence here exploration is about discovering unique resources, observing wildlife, and recording each find in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your refuge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your cabin from scratch and customize it with furniture, decorations, and handmade items. Create a cozy home where every detail reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook and cultivate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather plants, tend your garden, and combine ingredients to prepare over thirty recipes. Each dish is a new way to satisfy your hunger and enjoy the flavors of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live with animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From chickens and sheep to bees and wild creatures, animals are part of your daily life. Raise them, watch them, and live peacefully alongside them, finding companionship and unexpected rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A unique experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under Canopies redefines survival by leaving behind combat and danger. Here, you don\u2019t fight against nature you thrive with it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2939510?t=1772212788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772212788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772212788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772212788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2983200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1772212788\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1772212788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1772212788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore without fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a serene, vibrant forest full of mysteries. There\u2019s no hunting or violence here exploration is about discovering unique resources, observing wildlife, and recording each find in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your refuge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your cabin from scratch